	)
	(text "CV Buffer Functions:\n1. Buffer to drive the VCA CV input\n2. LPF at ~301Hz, Sallen Key two pole\n3. Rescale 3.3V range to 0.5V range\n   (Gives 82dB of gain control range)\n4. Shift range to 73mV to -427mV\n   (73mV = +12dB, -427mV = -80dB)\n5. Correct temperature drift by scaling CV\n   to compensate (using NTC thermistor)\n\n** Neg. Temp. Coeff. (NTC) Thermistor\n   Part No. NTCLE100E3473JB0 Vishay"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37.338 151.892 0)
